 "_source": "Every rule and number the training salon runs on, in one place. Read by website/_src/salon.py (pages) and copied by build.py to site/api/_lib/salon/policy.json (the booking engine cannot read _data/ at run time). Change a value here, rebuild, and it changes on the pages and in the engine together.",
 "_status": "Two kinds of unconfirmed value. {\"todo_pm\": true, \"value\": X} is a PLACEHOLDER nobody has decided: it is never printed, and the page says 'to be confirmed'. {\"pm_draft\": \"central scenario\", \"value\": X} is the PM's DRAFT (pricing input of 17 Nov 2026): it is printed, under a visible 'Draft prices' notice. While ANY value of either kind remains, the salon pages are noindex and out of the sitemap and the engine refuses to take a booking in production. To confirm a value, replace the whole object with the plain value.",
 "_units": "Money is pounds. Times are minutes, or HH:MM clock times in Europe/London. base_minutes is what a qualified stylist takes; a learner's appointment is base_minutes x the level's factor for the service's category, rounded up to five minutes, plus the educator's minutes.",
